          {
            "key": "solution",
            "html": "<p>Пре­об­ра­зу­ем левую часть не­ра­вен­ства:</p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"2^{\\log_5 x^2}+|x|^{\\log_5 4}=2^{\\log_5 x^2}+x^{2\\log_5 2}=2^{\\log_5 x^2}+2^{\\log_5 x^2}=2\\cdot 2^{\\log_5 x^2}.\"></span> </p></center><p>Пре­об­ра­зу­ем пра­вую часть не­ра­вен­ства:</p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"2\\cdot (\\frac{1}{2})^{\\log_{0{,}2} (x+6)}=2\\cdot 2^{\\log_{(5)} (x+6)}\"></span> . </p></center><p>Далее имеем:</p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"2\\cdot 2^{\\log_5 x^{2}}\\le 2\\cdot 2^{\\log_{(5)} (x+6)}\\iff \\log_5 x^{2}\\le \\log_{(5)} (x+6)\\iff \\begin{cases}x^{2}\\le x+6\\\\x\\ne 0\\end{cases}.\\quad \\iff\"></span> <br/> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\iff \\begin{cases}x^{2}-x-6\\le 0\\\\x\\ne 0\\end{cases}\\iff \\begin{cases}-2\\le x\\le 3\\\\x\\ne 0\\end{cases}.\\quad \\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}-2\\le x\\lt 0\\\\0\\lt x\\le 3\\end{aligned}\\right.\"></span> .</p><p> </p></center>",
            "title": "Решение",
