          {
            "key": "solution",
            "html": "<p>Пре­об­ра­зу­ем левую часть не­ра­вен­ства: </p><center><p><span><span data-inline-latex=\"2^{1+\\log_3 x^{2}}+2\\cdot \\left|x\\right|^{\\log_3 4}=2\\cdot 2^{\\log_3 x^{2}}+2\\cdot x^{2\\log_3 2}=2\\cdot 2^{\\log_3 x^{2}}+2\\cdot 2^{\\log_3 x^{2}}=4\\cdot 2^{\\log_3 x^{2}}\"></span> .</span> </p></center><p>Пре­об­ра­зу­ем пра­вую часть не­ра­вен­ства: </p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"4\\cdot (\\frac{1}{2})^{\\log_{(\\frac{1}{3})} (3x+4)}=4\\cdot 2^{\\log_{(3)} (3x+4)}\"></span> . </p></center><p>Далее имеем: </p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"4\\cdot 2^{\\log_3 x^{2}}\\le 4\\cdot 2^{\\log_{(3)} (3x+4)}\\iff \\log_3 x^{2}\\le \\log_{(3)} (3x+4)\\iff \\begin{cases}x^{2}\\le 3x+4\\\\x^{2}\\gt 0\\end{cases}.\\quad \\iff\"></span> <br/> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\iff \\begin{cases}x^{2}-3x-4\\le 0\\\\x\\ne 0\\end{cases}\\iff \\begin{cases}-1\\le x\\le 4\\\\x\\ne 0\\end{cases}.\\quad \\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}-1\\le x\\lt 0\\\\0\\lt x\\le 4\\end{aligned}\\right.\"></span> . </p><p></p></center>",
